.qodo
# Every env file, not just .env. These hold real credentials and must never be
# baked into an image: anyone who can pull it can read them, and they survive in
# the layer history even if a later step deletes the file.
.env
.env.*
*.md
!HANDOFF.md
bin/
domieface-server
domieface-server.exe
coverage.out
Makefile
